   "subject": "A little function to clean corpus files, e.g. text files from the Project Gutenberg",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi there,</div><div><br></div><div>I propose the following function to get rid of noise in text files such as texts from the Project Gutenberg. Any comments or suggestions are welcome!</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">#### This is a script to clean up corpus files from the Project Gutenberg ####</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">## Step 1: Load the corpus files into one vector of characters         </font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">## Step 2: Clean up the corpus files</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">clean.corpus.file&lt;-function(x, lowercase=F, numbers=F, punctuation=F, spaces=T, noise=T) {</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### a) x: a character string</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### b) lowercase</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">if(lowercase) {</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x&lt;-tolower(x)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">}</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### c) numbers</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">if(numbers) {</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x&lt;-gsub(&quot;[[:digit:]]&quot;, &quot;&quot;, x, perl=T)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">}</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### d) remove punctuation symbols</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">if(punctuation)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x&lt;-gsub(&quot;[[:punct:]]&quot;, &quot;&quot;, x, perl=T)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### e) remove extra white spaces</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">if(spaces) {</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x&lt;-gsub(&quot;[ \\t]{2,}&quot;, &quot; &quot;, x, perl=T)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x&lt;-gsub(&quot;^\\\\s+|\\\\s+$&quot;, &quot;&quot;, x, perl=T)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">}</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### f) remove noise, i.e. characters that do not count as words, punctuation marks, etc.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">if(noise) {</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x&lt;-gsub(&quot;(\\\\~*?|@*?|\\\\#*?|\\\\$*?|\\\\%*?|\\\\^*?|\\\\**?|\\\\{.*?\\\\}|_\\\\w*?|\\\\+*?|\\\\/|\\\\[.*?\\\\]|-.*?)&quot;, &quot;&quot;, x, perl=T)</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">}</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">### g) return</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">x</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">}</font></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
